### Allowed fraud review read
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "fraud_agent",
  "resource": "transaction_history",
  "action": "read",
  "context": {
    "workflow": "fraud_review",
    "risk": "medium"
  }
}

### Explicitly denied fraud transfer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "fraud_agent",
  "resource": "banking_transfer",
  "action": "execute",
  "context": {
    "workflow": "customer_transaction",
    "risk": "medium"
  }
}

### Ledger update requires manual review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "eod_agent",
  "resource": "ledger",
  "action": "update",
  "context": {
    "workflow": "eod_processing",
    "risk": "high",
    "human_approved": false
  }
}
